pipe Reverts

box alice as Alice
box usdc as USDC
box pool as Pool

hold alice: 100 USDC
hold pool: 0 USDC

step Move
  say USDC moves 100 from Alice to the pool. The change is still pending.
  alice -> usdc: send
  move usdc: 100 alice -> pool

step Fail
  say USDC fails, and every change inside it is undone.
  revert usdc: failed
